[0014] Abstract. The present invention relates to a synthesis process for the triketone-class herbicide tembotrione (tembotrione), comprising the following steps: 1) synthesis of 2-chloro-6-(methanesulfonyl)toluene; 2) synthesis of 2-chloro-3-acetyl-6-(methanesulfonyl)toluene; 3) synthesis of 2-chloro-3-methyl-4-(methanesulfonyl)benzoic acid; 4) synthesis of methyl 2-chloro-3-methyl-4-(methanesulfonyl)benzoate; 5) synthesis of methyl 2-chloro-3-(bromomethyl)-4-(methanesulfonyl)benzoate; 6) synthesis of 2-chloro-3-[(2,2,2-trifluoroethoxy)methyl]-4-(methanesulfonyl)benzoic acid; 7) synthesis of 3-oxo-1-cyclohexen-1-yl 2-chloro-3-[(2,2,2-trifluoroethoxy)methyl]-4-(methanesulfonyl)benzoate; 8) synthesis of tembotrione. The beneficial effects of the present invention are that: the reaction steps and time are shortened, and the yield of the intermediates is raised; the reaction conditions are milder and safer; the cost is lowered.
